    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "stop pretending... that's almost the part that hurts the most. i look at everything i've done and it feels like it belongs to someone else. someone who actually mattered. now i just feel like a ghost haunting my own life. like i'm just waiting for something to finally end so i don't have to keep performing this version of myself.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
